 "scenery": [],
 "par": {
  "time": 420
 },
 "intro": {
  "title": "ECHO MARKETS",
  "lines": [
   "A market town under the roof of the cave, round a well.",
   "Everyone in it is speaking softly. A shot here carries twice as far."
  ]
 },
 "outro": "The north gate opened when the hall had gone quiet. Behind it the stair goes down, and the noise of the market stays behind.",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "start",
   "at": [35, 62],
   "radius": 4,
   "speaker": "INES",
   "text": "A hall with a roof I can't see. Stalls, strings of lamps, and a crowd that's doing its buying in a murmur. Nobody here has a bell."
  },
  {
   "id": "echo",
   "at": [35, 57],
   "radius": 4,
   "speaker": "HULL",
   "text": "The hall has an echo: a shot carries twice as far as it does outside, and wakes what sleeps that far off. A blow, the arc lamp uncharged and the fork are quiet."
  },
  {
   "id": "folk",
   "at": [30, 50],
   "radius": 4,
   "speaker": "INES",
   "text": "A stallholder throws a cloth over the fruit as I pass, the way you cover a pan when a gull lands. Not at me. At what I'm carrying."
  },
  {
   "id": "zealot",
   "at": [22, 47],
   "radius": 4,
   "speaker": "INES",
   "text": "Spears among the stalls. They stand with the butts on the flags and nobody gives them room or takes any. Part of the furniture, like the bollards at home."
  },
  {
   "id": "well",
   "at": [20, 26],
   "radius": 4,
   "speaker": "HULL",
   "text": "The well is an echo well: a noise made over it comes back from the walls. Keep anything quiet away from it."
  },
  {
   "id": "ledger",
   "at": [27, 24],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "MARKET LEDGER",
   "text": "Cord, per length: one voice. Lamp oil, per tin: two. A room at the back, for a night: nothing, and ask no one."
  },
  {
   "id": "north",
   "at": [36, 11],
   "radius": 4,
   "speaker": "HULL",
   "text": "The north gate is on a sound-lock. It will not open while the hall has made a loud noise in the last six seconds. Wait, then use it."
  },
  {
   "id": "hollow",
   "at": [5, 35],
   "radius": 2,
   "speaker": "HULL",
   "text": "The west wall of the arcade rings hollow behind the last stall."
  },
  {
   "id": "rack",
   "at": [2, 35],
